	"note": "The single machine-readable mapping table for the Rust/Serde backend. Every other module in this directory derives its dispositions from these rows; no module restates a row. A construct that selects no row and no named refusal is an UNSUPPORTED_CONSTRUCT by FR-054-CON-1.",
